# Dockerfile.dockerignore, beside the Dockerfile it belongs to.
#
# This service builds from the REPOSITORY ROOT - the only context that
# can include the npm workspace's single package-lock.json - and Docker
# reads a plain .dockerignore only from the context root. A
# Dockerfile-specific ignore-file takes precedence over that root file,
# which keeps this list with the service it describes.
#
# The patterns are therefore repo-wide: ** so they match inside every
# service directory, not just the top level.
.git
.github
**/node_modules
**/deploy
**/*.md
